{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00614","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 景云舞 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 景云舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惟睿作圣，惟圣登皇。\n精感耀魄，时膺会昌。\n舜慙大孝，尧推让王。\n能事斯极，振古谁方。\n文明履运，车书同轨。\n巍巍赫赫，尽善尽美。\n衢室凝旒，大庭端扆。\n释负之寄，事光复子。\n脱屣高天，登遐上玄。\n龙湖超忽，象野芊绵。\n游衣复道，荐果初年。\n新庙奕奕，明德配天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}